OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThis evening
OL,6,Fwill be dry with some late brightness.
OL,7,FThen the rest of the night will be dry
OL,8,Fwith clear periods. Becoming chilly in
OL,9,Fsome sheltered glens.
OL,10,
OL,11,CThursday:FRain reaching western
OL,12,FTayside by late morning, then
OL,13,Foutbreaks of rain spreading across
OL,14,Fremaining areas by afternoon.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FDry and
OL,17,Fbright on Friday. Rain spreading east
OL,18,Ffor a time on Saturday. Drier and
OL,19,Fbrighter on Sunday with the chance of
OL,20,Fa few showers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
